[00:20.06]1. God has a new creation,
[00:29.06]His spirit-anointed sons.
[00:31.06]He has bought them from mankind;
[00:33.06]His approval they’ve won.
[00:35.06](Chorus)
[00:37.06]A special possession,
[00:39.06]They’re a people for your name.
[00:48.86]They love you. They praise you.
[00:53.78]As one they declare abroad your fame.
[01:11.71]2. They are a holy nation,
[01:14.71]Who handle the truth aright.
[01:17.71]God has called them from darkness
[01:20.71]To his wonderful light.
[01:26.21](Chorus)
[01:33.02]A special possession,
[01:37.72]They’re a people for your name.
[01:42.62]They love you. They praise you.
[01:47.52]As one they declare abroad your fame.
[02:05.47]3. Faithful to their commission,
[02:09.97]They gather the other sheep.
[02:16.99]To the Lamb they are loyal.
[02:21.43]His commandments they keep.
[02:25.87](Chorus)
[02:30.31]A special possession,
[02:34.75]They’re a people for your name.
[02:39.01]They love you. They praise you.
[02:43.93]As one they declare abroad your fame.